<title>USA: Garden City, Mich., won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Garden City, Mich., won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated said it won $9.935 million of Garden City, Mich., various limited tax bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.09 percent.</p>
